.build/

# The root .gitignore drops Package.resolved. This package pins its remote
# dependencies with `from:` ranges and the parent pins mlx-swift with
# `.upToNextMinor`, so without the lockfile two builds of the same tag can
# resolve different versions. The Homebrew formula builds from source, which
# makes the user's resolution the release: it has to be pinned.
#
# This also un-ignores the iOS app's own lockfile at
# App/ShakespeareReader.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/,
# which is wanted for the same reason. `xcuserdata/` needs no entry here: the
# root .gitignore already matches it at any depth, which covers the per-user
# scheme and window state Xcode writes beside the project.
!Package.resolved

# Your Apple Developer team id, for signing the iOS app. `App/Signing.xcconfig` is
# tracked and includes this one optionally, so a clone builds with no team set and
# nobody inherits anyone else's. See the comment in that file.
App/Local.xcconfig
